(6312677, 935413, 102534, '<td valign="top">A stream above the clouds! Now that is something I have never seen</td>', 'A stream above the clouds! Now that is something I have never seen', '2011-02-14 08:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312679, 933851, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W tones and love the play of light and shadow upon the girl''s hair, folds of dress, and skin. The mood is eerie and oddly tranquil. Serene and tranquil because you have the soft undulating flow of the dress and the flowing hair. The photo is eerie in the sense that the nose and mouth of this faceless girl is under the surface of the water - I get the surreal sense of her drowning.</td>', 'Great B&W tones and love the play of light and shadow upon the girl''s hair, folds of dress, and skin. The mood is eerie and oddly tranquil. Serene and tranquil because you have the soft undulating flow of the dress and the flowing hair. The photo is eerie in the sense that the nose and mouth of this faceless girl is under the surface of the water - I get the surreal sense of her drowning.', '2011-02-14 08:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312681, 934744, 102534, '<td valign="top">wow, that is CLOSE</td>', 'wow, that is CLOSE', '2011-02-14 08:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312682, 930044, 42256, '<td valign="top">Its a masterpiece! Amazing lighting! 10</td>', 'Its a masterpiece! Amazing lighting! 10', '2011-02-14 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312683, 935121, 60047, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture. Bright leaves in the foreground only a minor distraction.</td>', 'A beautiful capture. Bright leaves in the foreground only a minor distraction.', '2011-02-14 08:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312684, 935162, 43463, '<td valign="top">What a <u><i>cute </i></u>shot of these two ''youngsters'':-) Love the greeting they are giving each other...heh, normally it is the puppy/dog that has their tongue out ready to great someone. Here it is the boy that has his tongue out in a comic greeting.</td>', 'What a cute shot of these two ''youngsters'':-) Love the greeting they are giving each other...heh, normally it is the puppy/dog that has their tongue out ready to great someone. Here it is the boy that has his tongue out in a comic greeting.', '2011-02-14 08:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312687, 930023, 42256, '<td valign="top">You are a master at lighting Leo!</td>', 'You are a master at lighting Leo!', '2011-02-14 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312689, 931600, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! He''s just a tad blurred which is keeping you from a 9 or 10.</td>', 'Nice capture! He''s just a tad blurred which is keeping you from a 9 or 10.', '2011-02-14 08:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312690, 933077, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love it! A great moment captured.</td>', 'Love it! A great moment captured.', '2011-02-14 08:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312693, 934525, 60047, '<td valign="top">Perfect title. Noticeable post processing pixelation or noise issues in the upper 5th of the BG.</td>', 'Perfect title. Noticeable post processing pixelation or noise issues in the upper 5th of the BG.', '2011-02-14 08:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312695, 930023, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great post processing effects here. This could be ad copy.</td>', 'Wow. Great post processing effects here. This could be ad copy.', '2011-02-14 08:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312699, 935385, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at that fantastic blue in the glaciers! Love the mountainious region in the background that complements the shape and span of the ice-blue glaciers in the forefront. Clouds are spectacular. This is a high above average shot (7) but there is one thing holding it back from being in the exceptional category. Oh, no doubt the scene was fabulous to experience; not grading it on that but on the composition. I find that the reflections of the clouds in the water makes the composition too busy and draws focus away from those fabulous glaciers and the mountain range beyond. Cropping out the reflections of the ''popcorn'' clouds but keeping some of the water in the shot would allow your main focus to be stronger and shine.</td>', 'Wow, look at that fantastic blue in the glaciers! Love the mountainious region in the background that complements the shape and span of the ice-blue glaciers in the forefront. Clouds are spectacular. This is a high above average shot (7) but there is one thing holding it back from being in the exceptional category. Oh, no doubt the scene was fabulous to experience; not grading it on that but on the composition. I find that the reflections of the clouds in the water makes the composition too busy and draws focus away from those fabulous glaciers and the mountain range beyond. Cropping out the reflections of the ''popcorn'' clouds but keeping some of the water in the shot would allow your main focus to be stronger and shine.', '2011-02-14 08:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312707, 930863, 43463, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is just out and out spooky, eerie...and very well done. Love how you have the house framed between the two trees which silhouetted against the night sky evokes the feel of spookniness. The glowing floating word of ''alone'' hovers in front of the house. Home Alone - got that loud and clear. The hovering word shines in the night - perhaps it is the ghost of the house who is either communicating it is a lonely spirit or it is a warning to leave, leave this abode alone.</td>', 'Now THAT is just out and out spooky, eerie...and very well done. Love how you have the house framed between the two trees which silhouetted against the night sky evokes the feel of spookniness. The glowing floating word of ''alone'' hovers in front of the house. Home Alone - got that loud and clear. The hovering word shines in the night - perhaps it is the ghost of the house who is either communicating it is a lonely spirit or it is a warning to leave, leave this abode alone.', '2011-02-14 09:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
