(6313201, 934377, 72670, '<td valign="top">Great makeup, great colour. The skin tone is a little uneven ( my only nitpik) 8</td>', 'Great makeup, great colour. The skin tone is a little uneven ( my only nitpik) 8', '2011-02-14 13:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
