(6313248, 935188, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very emotional image, right now it connects to the way I feel.</td>', 'Very emotional image, right now it connects to the way I feel.', '2011-02-14 14:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313275, 934137, 43463, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean and elegant. Minimalism beautifully captured. Love how the trees emerge from the soft white environment. Nice touch with the three trees that are in the foreground that seem to come/ step forward towards us.</td>', 'Simple, clean and elegant. Minimalism beautifully captured. Love how the trees emerge from the soft white environment. Nice touch with the three trees that are in the foreground that seem to come/ step forward towards us.', '2011-02-14 14:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313283, 930319, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the soft hues of green and golds that decorate the scenery. The bushes in the lower left corner and the dappled branch of green and yellow leaves act as a natural frame for the photo. I also like you you have the fence emerge from the right corner to act as a leading line as it stretches out towards the fields. This is a lovely country morning with some soft rich colors.</td>', 'Love the soft hues of green and golds that decorate the scenery. The bushes in the lower left corner and the dappled branch of green and yellow leaves act as a natural frame for the photo. I also like you you have the fence emerge from the right corner to act as a leading line as it stretches out towards the fields. This is a lovely country morning with some soft rich colors.', '2011-02-14 14:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
