(6313329, 934914, 33182, '<td valign="top">I agree...simply radiant.<br/> <br/>The only critique I have is maybe desaturate the "whites" of her eyes to get rid of the blue cast to them. Other than that this is beautiful.</td>', 'I agree...simply radiant. The only critique I have is maybe desaturate the "whites" of her eyes to get rid of the blue cast to them. Other than that this is beautiful.', '2011-02-14 14:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
