(6313745, 931167, 43463, '<td valign="top">Nice little twist to this hat box - a lady pops out of the box to model the hat;-) Lighting is excellent and the red really pops off of the white and cream tones. Nicely done</td>', 'Nice little twist to this hat box - a lady pops out of the box to model the hat;-) Lighting is excellent and the red really pops off of the white and cream tones. Nicely done', '2011-02-14 19:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313751, 932125, 51747, '<td valign="top">I love your colors.</td>', 'I love your colors.', '2011-02-14 19:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313753, 932833, 43463, '<td valign="top">Well this little girl is getting an early taste of photography LOL :-) Cute girl with lovely big eyes. I''m sure she would be just as happy gumming on a large oreo cookie (which is what I first thought when looking at the thumbnail before the title) as she is with the lens cap. Composition is well lit, B&amp;W tones are great, subject is well captured with cuteness and humor thrown in for interest.</td>', 'Well this little girl is getting an early taste of photography LOL :-) Cute girl with lovely big eyes. I''m sure she would be just as happy gumming on a large oreo cookie (which is what I first thought when looking at the thumbnail before the title) as she is with the lens cap. Composition is well lit, B&W tones are great, subject is well captured with cuteness and humor thrown in for interest.', '2011-02-14 19:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313763, 933053, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic portrait. I love how it is sharp and soft all in one. Looking at this truly seems to transport me into another world. I want to know what he is looking at.<br/>The background did turn out kind of funky. But the subject is such a strong draw that I really had to look for a while before I noticed. Great job, your entry stood out to me among so very many. 9</td>', 'This is a fantastic portrait. I love how it is sharp and soft all in one. Looking at this truly seems to transport me into another world. I want to know what he is looking at.The background did turn out kind of funky. But the subject is such a strong draw that I really had to look for a while before I noticed. Great job, your entry stood out to me among so very many. 9', '2011-02-14 19:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313769, 932536, 43463, '<td valign="top">Chalk up a good score for creativity and humor - love the expression on the model as she fearfully explores the chalk world she has been ''shrunk'' into. Only small (tiny really) critique I can give is that the hat could have either been lightened so that it doesn''t blend into the blacktop or a different color hat that would have contrasted better.</td>', 'Chalk up a good score for creativity and humor - love the expression on the model as she fearfully explores the chalk world she has been ''shrunk'' into. Only small (tiny really) critique I can give is that the hat could have either been lightened so that it doesn''t blend into the blacktop or a different color hat that would have contrasted better.', '2011-02-14 19:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313771, 933247, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that single house really grounds the shot.  Such beautiful magenta.  I''d love to see this larger. :)</td>', 'Oh that single house really grounds the shot.  Such beautiful magenta.  I''d love to see this larger. :)', '2011-02-14 19:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313772, 931054, 115307, '<td valign="top">At first I was disappointed that there was no mouse or animal in this picture. Then I remembered a fact from my biology class that owls can hear mice and stuff moving under the snow, and then strike through it. I am assuming that is what is happening here? So cool! The impact on the snow would have also made an awesome picture. 8</td>', 'At first I was disappointed that there was no mouse or animal in this picture. Then I remembered a fact from my biology class that owls can hear mice and stuff moving under the snow, and then strike through it. I am assuming that is what is happening here? So cool! The impact on the snow would have also made an awesome picture. 8', '2011-02-14 19:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313777, 934685, 115307, '<td valign="top">Such a tender moment. The vignetting makes this moment seem even more magical. I love how the foal is so watchful while the mother is so caring. Great shot, I love it. 8</td>', 'Such a tender moment. The vignetting makes this moment seem even more magical. I love how the foal is so watchful while the mother is so caring. Great shot, I love it. 8', '2011-02-14 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313788, 933039, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think this might be too neon green for some people, but I am a huge fan! I tend to adore subtle bokeh backgrounds anyways, and I just love how the colors shift from green to blue to yellow in this one. Great shot 8</td>', 'I think this might be too neon green for some people, but I am a huge fan! I tend to adore subtle bokeh backgrounds anyways, and I just love how the colors shift from green to blue to yellow in this one. Great shot 8', '2011-02-14 19:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313789, 935338, 115307, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp and very intimidating looking. Kudos for not completely overdoing the orange saturation here, I find that happens a lot for tiger pictures, but here the hues look perfect to me. 8</td>', 'Tack sharp and very intimidating looking. Kudos for not completely overdoing the orange saturation here, I find that happens a lot for tiger pictures, but here the hues look perfect to me. 8', '2011-02-14 19:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313792, 935687, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, it tells such a great story. The foot posture along with the blurry waiting boy in the back is a really great combination, not to mention the awesome lighting here.<br/>The only thing that bugs me here is that elbow, it feels a bit intrusive since it just barely peeks into the picture.<br/>Great moment. 7</td>', 'I really like this photo, it tells such a great story. The foot posture along with the blurry waiting boy in the back is a really great combination, not to mention the awesome lighting here.The only thing that bugs me here is that elbow, it feels a bit intrusive since it just barely peeks into the picture.Great moment. 7', '2011-02-14 19:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313794, 935289, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is great. I think the black and white conversion is just perfect here. Lovely contrast without losing the important details. I can stare at this photo for a long time. 7</td>', 'This is great. I think the black and white conversion is just perfect here. Lovely contrast without losing the important details. I can stare at this photo for a long time. 7', '2011-02-14 19:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313795, 931898, 43463, '<td valign="top">Colors in the sky and clouds are reminiscent of that what you see in Maxfield Parrish paintings. Lovely and ethereal in color - very pretty to look at in a photograph but not enough to capture and hold one''s attention for long. I think (and this is just my opinion) it needs an additional element that would add some umph to the composition; it could be a plane, a kite, sunbeams fanning out from the clouds, a hot air balloon, a hang-glider, a flock of birds are just some examples to name a few.</td>', 'Colors in the sky and clouds are reminiscent of that what you see in Maxfield Parrish paintings. Lovely and ethereal in color - very pretty to look at in a photograph but not enough to capture and hold one''s attention for long. I think (and this is just my opinion) it needs an additional element that would add some umph to the composition; it could be a plane, a kite, sunbeams fanning out from the clouds, a hot air balloon, a hang-glider, a flock of birds are just some examples to name a few.', '2011-02-14 19:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313798, 934748, 115307, '<td valign="top">The selective desat works really well, and I think this is a really strong cat portrait. He/she really seems to be staring into my soul. The only shame is that the focus is clearly on the forehead more so than the eyes.</td>', 'The selective desat works really well, and I think this is a really strong cat portrait. He/she really seems to be staring into my soul. The only shame is that the focus is clearly on the forehead more so than the eyes.', '2011-02-14 19:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313799, 935713, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful natural portrait. It really seems to convey her essence to the viewer in a way that most posed artificial portraits do not. Is that a microphone she is wearing? That is the only thing that I find distracting</td>', 'Beautiful natural portrait. It really seems to convey her essence to the viewer in a way that most posed artificial portraits do not. Is that a microphone she is wearing? That is the only thing that I find distracting', '2011-02-14 19:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
