(6313854, 935667, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, it must have been super windy on that day. I like the muted colors and the fact that you have named him :-)</td>', 'Wow, it must have been super windy on that day. I like the muted colors and the fact that you have named him :-)', '2011-02-14 20:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313856, 931053, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!</td>', 'This is wonderful!', '2011-02-14 20:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313858, 930063, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high key picture. I don''t mind the blownout skin in the least. Its funny how absolutely vital that elbow is, to allow the viewer to imagine the rest of the body. Who would have thought elbows can be that important. I love the focus on the eye. 8</td>', 'Beautiful high key picture. I don''t mind the blownout skin in the least. Its funny how absolutely vital that elbow is, to allow the viewer to imagine the rest of the body. Who would have thought elbows can be that important. I love the focus on the eye. 8', '2011-02-14 20:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313860, 930301, 115307, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous black and white landscape. The high contrast between the light top and dark bottom of the image is beautiful. I also love the movement of the water along that rock. 7</td>', 'Gorgeous black and white landscape. The high contrast between the light top and dark bottom of the image is beautiful. I also love the movement of the water along that rock. 7', '2011-02-14 20:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313861, 934111, 113411, '<td valign="top">really fabulous!</td>', 'really fabulous!', '2011-02-14 20:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313862, 931094, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very mystical and pretty. I think this picture could have benefited from an increased contrast and a subtle curves shift. There is a very strong green color cast. I do love the contrast between the light trees on the right and the dark trees on the left</td>', 'Very mystical and pretty. I think this picture could have benefited from an increased contrast and a subtle curves shift. There is a very strong green color cast. I do love the contrast between the light trees on the right and the dark trees on the left', '2011-02-14 20:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313863, 932021, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love how the two clocks seemingly mimic the moon. Good shot!</td>', 'I love how the two clocks seemingly mimic the moon. Good shot!', '2011-02-14 20:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313864, 934726, 115307, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I love pictures of decay like this. They are eternally interesting to look at. You did a great job with the lighting here. 7</td>', 'Awesome! I love pictures of decay like this. They are eternally interesting to look at. You did a great job with the lighting here. 7', '2011-02-14 20:21:21.000000', NULL, 1);
