(6314147, 934603, 33002, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.....but I find a few things very distracting. The ?houses? in the middle right, dim them down. Also the dark ridge on the left draws my eye down to a big dull green rock. Try to pull the eye to the gorgeous rock in the foreground. Just my opinion</td>', 'Love the colors.....but I find a few things very distracting. The ?houses? in the middle right, dim them down. Also the dark ridge on the left draws my eye down to a big dull green rock. Try to pull the eye to the gorgeous rock in the foreground. Just my opinion', '2011-02-14 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
