(6314811, 931206, 68947, '<td valign="top">This shot really made me stop and stare!  I LOVE the statement that this shot is making and that there is a message behind it as opposed to the usual DPC Advertising shot style!  It''s SO refreshing to see a real photo of realism and making a statement...unposed for....un-set up without lighting set ups and angles and tripods.  I figure you took this out a car window???  BRILLIANT!!!  If I could give you a 20, I would...but, I can only give you a 10....you have my 10 on this!!!!  :)  Congrats on a fabulous shot!!!!  KUDOS!</td>', 'This shot really made me stop and stare!  I LOVE the statement that this shot is making and that there is a message behind it as opposed to the usual DPC Advertising shot style!  It''s SO refreshing to see a real photo of realism and making a statement...unposed for....un-set up without lighting set ups and angles and tripods.  I figure you took this out a car window???  BRILLIANT!!!  If I could give you a 20, I would...but, I can only give you a 10....you have my 10 on this!!!!  :)  Congrats on a fabulous shot!!!!  KUDOS!', '2011-02-15 10:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
