(6315093, 931206, 33002, '<td valign="top">What can be said here.......How tiny is that guy kissing the other? And what the H-E double hockey sticks is the homophobe doing with a knot in his shirt?</td>', 'What can be said here.......How tiny is that guy kissing the other? And what the H-E double hockey sticks is the homophobe doing with a knot in his shirt?', '2011-02-15 13:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
