(6315107, 935643, 69034, '<td valign="top">Beautiful industrial photograph.  Love the irony of the imagerly most people have of the title vs. the reality.</td>', 'Beautiful industrial photograph.  Love the irony of the imagerly most people have of the title vs. the reality.', '2011-02-15 13:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
