(6315147, 935487, 103004, '<td valign="top">So cute! Excellent photo</td>', 'So cute! Excellent photo', '2011-02-15 14:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315149, 934968, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very stunning portrait. Great lighting and she has some lovely catchlights in her eyes that draw the viewer in. This photo has lovely jewel tone colors of blue and purple that drape and frame her face. Well done.</td>', 'Very stunning portrait. Great lighting and she has some lovely catchlights in her eyes that draw the viewer in. This photo has lovely jewel tone colors of blue and purple that drape and frame her face. Well done.', '2011-02-15 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315152, 931092, 33002, '<td valign="top">Needs help... Seems to have something on the lens. And is over processed</td>', 'Needs help... Seems to have something on the lens. And is over processed', '2011-02-15 14:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315162, 931358, 43463, '<td valign="top">I was going to start off that I think a vertical orientation would have better complemented/subtley alluded to the height of the giraffe and the tree, but studying the composition more I think you made the better choice of horizontal. I get the feel of a wide open savanna - wide and majestic in scope and then, one lone tree with this great giraffe strolling up to it. The B&amp;W and the silhouettes of the main subjects with the negative space of the sky just focuses my attention all the more to the tree and giraffe. Simple and beautifully minimal in presentation.</td>', 'I was going to start off that I think a vertical orientation would have better complemented/subtley alluded to the height of the giraffe and the tree, but studying the composition more I think you made the better choice of horizontal. I get the feel of a wide open savanna - wide and majestic in scope and then, one lone tree with this great giraffe strolling up to it. The B&W and the silhouettes of the main subjects with the negative space of the sky just focuses my attention all the more to the tree and giraffe. Simple and beautifully minimal in presentation.', '2011-02-15 14:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315163, 935676, 43774, '<td valign="top">I want this to win. In fact I want it to get the highest score ever on DPC. It is stunning, beautiful, perfect.............nothing I could say can describe how amazing this photo is!!</td>', 'I want this to win. In fact I want it to get the highest score ever on DPC. It is stunning, beautiful, perfect.............nothing I could say can describe how amazing this photo is!!', '2011-02-15 14:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315165, 931490, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my highest rated photos in the challenge. I love the bright colours.</td>', 'One of my highest rated photos in the challenge. I love the bright colours.', '2011-02-15 14:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315166, 934787, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!! In my top 5.</td>', 'This is stunning!! In my top 5.', '2011-02-15 14:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315167, 935068, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, beautiful photo. In my top 5.</td>', 'Beautiful light, beautiful photo. In my top 5.', '2011-02-15 14:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315168, 933411, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and colour, I love this. In my top 5.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and colour, I love this. In my top 5.', '2011-02-15 14:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315177, 935344, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love how the light illuminates this mighty train engine as it belts out steam and smoke. I can almost hear the hiss of the steam of this engine. It is a good shot and it has much potential to be a <i>great</i> shot - the one thing that the composition suffers for is that the full front of the engine is halved. Had you captured the full front within the composition it would be much stronger in the presentation of this Iron Horse.</td>', 'I love how the light illuminates this mighty train engine as it belts out steam and smoke. I can almost hear the hiss of the steam of this engine. It is a good shot and it has much potential to be a great shot - the one thing that the composition suffers for is that the full front of the engine is halved. Had you captured the full front within the composition it would be much stronger in the presentation of this Iron Horse.', '2011-02-15 14:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315188, 932007, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very lovely B&amp;W photo showcasing the beauty of the Sydney Operahouse at night. Love the swoop and lines of the building structure you have captured here. The biggest detraction to the photo is the faint odd circular spots that appear in the night sky and the heavy grain that is most noticable in the dark tones of the sky. The spots almost look like there was raindrops on the camera lens. Selective editing and feathering of selection of sky to either gamma &amp; shadow/highlights to darken the sky so the light tones of the opera house pop even more and hopefully the spots would disappear. It not, might have to go over it carefully with clone tool to minimalize or make the circles disappear.</td>', 'Very lovely B&W photo showcasing the beauty of the Sydney Operahouse at night. Love the swoop and lines of the building structure you have captured here. The biggest detraction to the photo is the faint odd circular spots that appear in the night sky and the heavy grain that is most noticable in the dark tones of the sky. The spots almost look like there was raindrops on the camera lens. Selective editing and feathering of selection of sky to either gamma & shadow/highlights to darken the sky so the light tones of the opera house pop even more and hopefully the spots would disappear. It not, might have to go over it carefully with clone tool to minimalize or make the circles disappear.', '2011-02-15 14:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315209, 930423, 4517, '<td valign="top">This is amazing and my 1st photo to vote on. Great tones.<br/>Not sure about the crop. I may have cropped from the top for a more panaramic look but still a 10+ fav</td>', 'This is amazing and my 1st photo to vote on. Great tones.Not sure about the crop. I may have cropped from the top for a more panaramic look but still a 10+ fav', '2011-02-15 15:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
