(6315260, 933612, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is just fan bloody tastic "Mate". I love all things train. This image captures the solitude and endless/timeless/hassle free imagery of train travel. One day I might join you from Adelaide to Darwin. Composition and processing is beaut. I''ll easily hang this on my wall in my train room. Hope it does well for you. My 2nd x 10 after 251 votes. Faved.</td>', 'Wow, this is just fan bloody tastic "Mate". I love all things train. This image captures the solitude and endless/timeless/hassle free imagery of train travel. One day I might join you from Adelaide to Darwin. Composition and processing is beaut. I''ll easily hang this on my wall in my train room. Hope it does well for you. My 2nd x 10 after 251 votes. Faved.', '2011-02-15 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
