(6315551, 934377, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait, and I really love all of the small touches here, especially the grass on her lips.<br/>The only criticism I have is that the red leaf on her forehead is a huge draw for the eye because it is the brightest thing in the picture, and therefore draws our eyes away from HER eyes, which are stunning. Otherwise perfect. 8</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait, and I really love all of the small touches here, especially the grass on her lips.The only criticism I have is that the red leaf on her forehead is a huge draw for the eye because it is the brightest thing in the picture, and therefore draws our eyes away from HER eyes, which are stunning. Otherwise perfect. 8', '2011-02-15 18:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
