(6315638, 930023, 27608, '<td valign="top">This is very cool!  And I think I''ve found your shot Leo :)  I remember her from link on your Sports IV shot, cause you beat me :)  Hehe.  Checking now, it doesn''t help that you''ve hid them now, but the thumbnails are still showing up!  An excellent shot, and I love your post processing.  How do you do it?</td>', 'This is very cool!  And I think I''ve found your shot Leo :)  I remember her from link on your Sports IV shot, cause you beat me :)  Hehe.  Checking now, it doesn''t help that you''ve hid them now, but the thumbnails are still showing up!  An excellent shot, and I love your post processing.  How do you do it?', '2011-02-15 19:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
