(6315802, 935012, 43463, '<td valign="top">The houses on the row do look very beautiful at that time of the year - and the reflections just add to the beauty. This is a nice capture but there is one big thing that really mars the beauty of the scene. Heavy noise that appears in the night sky and the dark portions of the river. It is a mottled mix of red/blue blotches. Either a good noise reduction program will take care of that or lowering the ISO to 100 or even 50 to reduce the noise when taking a nighttime shot (of course then you will have to lower the shutter speed to 1/2 second or more that would call for a tripod to get a steady unblurred shot)</td>', 'The houses on the row do look very beautiful at that time of the year - and the reflections just add to the beauty. This is a nice capture but there is one big thing that really mars the beauty of the scene. Heavy noise that appears in the night sky and the dark portions of the river. It is a mottled mix of red/blue blotches. Either a good noise reduction program will take care of that or lowering the ISO to 100 or even 50 to reduce the noise when taking a nighttime shot (of course then you will have to lower the shutter speed to 1/2 second or more that would call for a tripod to get a steady unblurred shot)', '2011-02-15 21:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315804, 934909, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The lighting is very good.</td>', 'Nice capture. The lighting is very good.', '2011-02-15 21:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315810, 934745, 23484, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic. Nice strong contrast.</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic. Nice strong contrast.', '2011-02-15 21:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315811, 930429, 23484, '<td valign="top">The processing is excellent for this image.</td>', 'The processing is excellent for this image.', '2011-02-15 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315816, 934148, 23484, '<td valign="top">The processing really accentuates the architecture.</td>', 'The processing really accentuates the architecture.', '2011-02-15 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315819, 931092, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent night shot. Great processing.</td>', 'Excellent night shot. Great processing.', '2011-02-15 21:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315823, 934101, 43463, '<td valign="top">The Grove Arcade yes? Been in the vicinity twice while on vacation and never had the time to go in. Beautiful with all the iron scroll work on the stairs the shoppes and the open feel provided by that lovely large skylight ceiling. Love the composition where the stairwell opens up like a stage that leads my eye onward. Nice splash of color in the center with the red restaurant umbrellas and the U.S. flag that hangs overhead. This must have been really early morning for their is not a soul in sight (or maybe it is when their was that snowstorm that most did not want to venture out). Because there is no one strolling the mall the composition shows off some wonderful lines and the huge expanse of the place.</td>', 'The Grove Arcade yes? Been in the vicinity twice while on vacation and never had the time to go in. Beautiful with all the iron scroll work on the stairs the shoppes and the open feel provided by that lovely large skylight ceiling. Love the composition where the stairwell opens up like a stage that leads my eye onward. Nice splash of color in the center with the red restaurant umbrellas and the U.S. flag that hangs overhead. This must have been really early morning for their is not a soul in sight (or maybe it is when their was that snowstorm that most did not want to venture out). Because there is no one strolling the mall the composition shows off some wonderful lines and the huge expanse of the place.', '2011-02-15 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315826, 932158, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2011-02-15 21:51:37.000000', NULL, 1);
