(6315838, 934785, 51747, '<td valign="top">Those clouds are pretty dramatic. They look a little out of place with the rest of the image. Definitely interesting to look at.</td>', 'Those clouds are pretty dramatic. They look a little out of place with the rest of the image. Definitely interesting to look at.', '2011-02-15 21:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315841, 930023, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well composed, love the bird in the photo. 8</td>', 'Well composed, love the bird in the photo. 8', '2011-02-15 22:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315844, 935676, 43463, '<td valign="top">That is some stunning and vibrant colors on those tulips! And this shot at night no less. The windmill is another fabulous element to the composition. Love the sweep of the star trails that makes me think of ''wind''. A solar wind that provides beauty to the scene and rather than moving the panels of the windmill their beauty coupled with the tulips moves your audience. Breathlessly beautiful.</td>', 'That is some stunning and vibrant colors on those tulips! And this shot at night no less. The windmill is another fabulous element to the composition. Love the sweep of the star trails that makes me think of ''wind''. A solar wind that provides beauty to the scene and rather than moving the panels of the windmill their beauty coupled with the tulips moves your audience. Breathlessly beautiful.', '2011-02-15 22:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
