(6315967, 934708, 127046, '<td valign="top">I think if you had gridded the light, and put it on her face... and let the lights in the curtains come out a bit more by dragging the shutter... it might have made the ambient pop a bit more.</td>', 'I think if you had gridded the light, and put it on her face... and let the lights in the curtains come out a bit more by dragging the shutter... it might have made the ambient pop a bit more.', '2011-02-15 23:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315972, 935488, 127046, '<td valign="top">Personally, I would have done a bit of lens correction in photoshop to take out the distortion for this shot... but that is just my take.</td>', 'Personally, I would have done a bit of lens correction in photoshop to take out the distortion for this shot... but that is just my take.', '2011-02-15 23:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315973, 935070, 127046, '<td valign="top">I think the soft look on a male isn''t the best look, especially in contrast to the stomach "roughness." These are exceptionally hard shots to pull off without making them look creepy in my opinion... It could also just be me.</td>', 'I think the soft look on a male isn''t the best look, especially in contrast to the stomach "roughness." These are exceptionally hard shots to pull off without making them look creepy in my opinion... It could also just be me.', '2011-02-15 23:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315975, 934995, 127046, '<td valign="top">Great view, and the comp is pretty good... but what is going on here? Is this a scan from a print? A low megapixel camera? Bad HDR (My bet is here)? This looks like it could be a fantastic shot if the post processing wasn''t introducing so much noise.</td>', 'Great view, and the comp is pretty good... but what is going on here? Is this a scan from a print? A low megapixel camera? Bad HDR (My bet is here)? This looks like it could be a fantastic shot if the post processing wasn''t introducing so much noise.', '2011-02-15 23:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
