(6316068, 932090, 33002, '<td valign="top">Love the portrait! Colors and depth are spot on. These uses of the glass is distracting, and takes away, also the hand is washed out. Good Luck</td>', 'Love the portrait! Colors and depth are spot on. These uses of the glass is distracting, and takes away, also the hand is washed out. Good Luck', '2011-02-16 00:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
