(6316148, 930064, 33002, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, however would have like to have seen the focus a bit more precise. the foreground is very distracting. Good Luck!</td>', 'Nice photo, however would have like to have seen the focus a bit more precise. the foreground is very distracting. Good Luck!', '2011-02-16 00:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
