(6316587, 935421, 114233, '<td valign="top">I had to sit and think about why this image isnt making me like it the more I look at it. Is it the PP? Is it the fact that the person is so small in the shot? Is it that I can barely see the little green foliage in between the stones? Is it the dark top right corner? It is a nice shot but something is just not relating to me.</td>', 'I had to sit and think about why this image isnt making me like it the more I look at it. Is it the PP? Is it the fact that the person is so small in the shot? Is it that I can barely see the little green foliage in between the stones? Is it the dark top right corner? It is a nice shot but something is just not relating to me.', '2011-02-16 09:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
