(6316624, 935329, 114233, '<td valign="top">Composition is good but probably could have been a bit tighter... too much blue and hair distracts from the stare. The shot needs to be sharper though so that we can see the eyes, eyebrows and eyelashes more clearly</td>', 'Composition is good but probably could have been a bit tighter... too much blue and hair distracts from the stare. The shot needs to be sharper though so that we can see the eyes, eyebrows and eyelashes more clearly', '2011-02-16 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
