(6316631, 934603, 60047, '<td valign="top">The focus immediately draws your eye to the wonderful burst of orange lichen on the boulder.. The other features such as the mottled light on the rolling hills and the large hill centered in the back are de-emphasized due to being out of the focus DOF. I would love to see this same shot in a smaller aperture version so that these features would be in focus along with the lichen.</td>', 'The focus immediately draws your eye to the wonderful burst of orange lichen on the boulder.. The other features such as the mottled light on the rolling hills and the large hill centered in the back are de-emphasized due to being out of the focus DOF. I would love to see this same shot in a smaller aperture version so that these features would be in focus along with the lichen.', '2011-02-16 09:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
