(6316724, 931515, 98339, '<td valign="top">let me tell you that getting one of these buggers to "sit still" is very hard you have great clarity on the head...good job</td>', 'let me tell you that getting one of these buggers to "sit still" is very hard you have great clarity on the head...good job', '2011-02-16 10:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
