(6316855, 935690, 127608, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and I like how there is motion in your picture but the car is clear. It is composed nice but looks a little flat to me. I would like to see some colors pop.</td>', 'Nice depth of field and I like how there is motion in your picture but the car is clear. It is composed nice but looks a little flat to me. I would like to see some colors pop.', '2011-02-16 12:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
