(6316874, 930047, 127608, '<td valign="top">Animals are hard to capture but this would have been better if the little one and mom were both facing camera</td>', 'Animals are hard to capture but this would have been better if the little one and mom were both facing camera', '2011-02-16 12:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
