(6316970, 931774, 96751, '<td valign="top">Magical.  As though the left side is developing from the vagueness of the right.</td>', 'Magical.  As though the left side is developing from the vagueness of the right.', '2011-02-16 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316972, 935625, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, colorful portrait.  Tell her she has amazing lips.</td>', 'Gorgeous, colorful portrait.  Tell her she has amazing lips.', '2011-02-16 12:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316973, 935338, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very noble and elegant.</td>', 'Very noble and elegant.', '2011-02-16 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316974, 930222, 96751, '<td valign="top">I was driving by, sitting on the bus, looking out the window in a distracted manner, when my eye caught something.  I don''t remember what it was but it felt like it was significant.</td>', 'I was driving by, sitting on the bus, looking out the window in a distracted manner, when my eye caught something.  I don''t remember what it was but it felt like it was significant.', '2011-02-16 12:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316975, 930539, 96751, '<td valign="top">What an incredible place</td>', 'What an incredible place', '2011-02-16 12:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316977, 931094, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very 19th century pastoral</td>', 'Very 19th century pastoral', '2011-02-16 12:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316978, 934140, 96751, '<td valign="top">The return of the Escheresque library.  Awesome.</td>', 'The return of the Escheresque library.  Awesome.', '2011-02-16 12:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316981, 933077, 96751, '<td valign="top">What an exhilarating image.</td>', 'What an exhilarating image.', '2011-02-16 13:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316982, 935385, 114233, '<td valign="top">This hurts it is so nice! Lovely PP work. My only nit is the reflection of the biggest ice peak on the left is so much darker than the rest of the reflections. I still think it would have worked without making it that dark. Still an amazing shot though!</td>', 'This hurts it is so nice! Lovely PP work. My only nit is the reflection of the biggest ice peak on the left is so much darker than the rest of the reflections. I still think it would have worked without making it that dark. Still an amazing shot though!', '2011-02-16 13:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316983, 935408, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nicely pp''d.  Sharpened just right.</td>', 'Nicely pp''d.  Sharpened just right.', '2011-02-16 13:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316984, 933039, 114233, '<td valign="top">Its almost amazing how well the background mimics the bird... green below to match the green feathers, yellow top left to match the wing with the light shining through the feathers, blues top right to match the beak... Magical!<br/>Not sure if the extreme highlights are blown or not but they are a little distracting</td>', 'Its almost amazing how well the background mimics the bird... green below to match the green feathers, yellow top left to match the wing with the light shining through the feathers, blues top right to match the beak... Magical!Not sure if the extreme highlights are blown or not but they are a little distracting', '2011-02-16 13:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316985, 933539, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, the clouds collaborated to give you gorgeous dappled light.</td>', 'Ah, the clouds collaborated to give you gorgeous dappled light.', '2011-02-16 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316989, 932158, 114233, '<td valign="top">Magnificent - incredibly sharp focus. Love the water drops and the lighting. I wish the Stamen on the lower right werent dark / damaged</td>', 'Magnificent - incredibly sharp focus. Love the water drops and the lighting. I wish the Stamen on the lower right werent dark / damaged', '2011-02-16 13:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316990, 935660, 114233, '<td valign="top">The title - I looked it up on Wiki and it says  procrastination, lack of motivation, a drop in academic performance, a desire to drop out of school... Not sure how it fits here unless this is a student that is meant to be working.<br/>The picture - I really like it. The lighting is excellent and the composition is really pleasing to the eye. The only small nit is the lighter "beam" of light coming out of the flowers and extending to the right of the frame.</td>', 'The title - I looked it up on Wiki and it says  procrastination, lack of motivation, a drop in academic performance, a desire to drop out of school... Not sure how it fits here unless this is a student that is meant to be working.The picture - I really like it. The lighting is excellent and the composition is really pleasing to the eye. The only small nit is the lighter "beam" of light coming out of the flowers and extending to the right of the frame.', '2011-02-16 13:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316991, 931036, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous conversion.  Love the contrasting lines and textures.</td>', 'Gorgeous conversion.  Love the contrasting lines and textures.', '2011-02-16 13:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316992, 934923, 114233, '<td valign="top">After...the Mother ship has just left...<br/>Just joking - a very heavy PP effect but I actually really like it! It emphasizes the beams of light coming through the clouds. The leading lines in the field draw your eye to the beams. Composition is really good too. Might not be eye-candy enough to really do well but I sure like it.</td>', 'After...the Mother ship has just left...Just joking - a very heavy PP effect but I actually really like it! It emphasizes the beams of light coming through the clouds. The leading lines in the field draw your eye to the beams. Composition is really good too. Might not be eye-candy enough to really do well but I sure like it.', '2011-02-16 13:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316993, 934744, 114233, '<td valign="top">Beauty is in the eye of the beholder though... haha<br/>A truly special shot.  I know the DOF is extremely shallow in macro but I wish more of the front half of the face was in focus too... maybe even the whole drop of water as well. Composition is really good though!</td>', 'Beauty is in the eye of the beholder though... hahaA truly special shot.  I know the DOF is extremely shallow in macro but I wish more of the front half of the face was in focus too... maybe even the whole drop of water as well. Composition is really good though!', '2011-02-16 13:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316994, 931774, 114233, '<td valign="top">One of the best I have seen so far - these shots really appeal to me. The jetty seems to be leading us from the dark (evil) towards the light (good). Not sure about the cropped tree / island on the left though - a little distracting.</td>', 'One of the best I have seen so far - these shots really appeal to me. The jetty seems to be leading us from the dark (evil) towards the light (good). Not sure about the cropped tree / island on the left though - a little distracting.', '2011-02-16 13:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316995, 934962, 114233, '<td valign="top">The stillness of death contrasted by the movement of life (water). Very interesting. Might be a little underexposed but it goes with the dark theme of death I guess. The subject is very sharp and stands out quite well from the BG. Made me think - but very macabre</td>', 'The stillness of death contrasted by the movement of life (water). Very interesting. Might be a little underexposed but it goes with the dark theme of death I guess. The subject is very sharp and stands out quite well from the BG. Made me think - but very macabre', '2011-02-16 13:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316996, 933108, 114233, '<td valign="top">I bet you people are going to say that the horison is skew... even though it is getting closer to you on the right hand side. A very nice shot and PP suits the image very nicely. It might have a bit too much space on the top though as the clouds arent as interesting all the way to the edge of the frame.</td>', 'I bet you people are going to say that the horison is skew... even though it is getting closer to you on the right hand side. A very nice shot and PP suits the image very nicely. It might have a bit too much space on the top though as the clouds arent as interesting all the way to the edge of the frame.', '2011-02-16 13:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316998, 935570, 114233, '<td valign="top">Love the trees on top of the old pillars! Wonderful PP work and captures the mood well. Maybe a touch more contrast in the clouds would have highlighted the edges of the storm clouds coming</td>', 'Love the trees on top of the old pillars! Wonderful PP work and captures the mood well. Maybe a touch more contrast in the clouds would have highlighted the edges of the storm clouds coming', '2011-02-16 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317000, 933523, 114233, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully crisp and clear shot. Nice PP work on the subject</td>', 'Wonderfully crisp and clear shot. Nice PP work on the subject', '2011-02-16 13:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317001, 935362, 114233, '<td valign="top">Great detail and crispness. Lovely isolation of the subject even though the BG is has the same tones as the subject! Good PP. Should do well</td>', 'Great detail and crispness. Lovely isolation of the subject even though the BG is has the same tones as the subject! Good PP. Should do well', '2011-02-16 13:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317004, 931244, 114233, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for these shots. Looks incredible!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for these shots. Looks incredible!', '2011-02-16 13:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317006, 935708, 114233, '<td valign="top">I had a 1,000 piece puzzle when I was younger with EXACTLY this scene! That tree hasnt grown in about 20 years. Nice shot but PP let you down a little. Blues look too oversaturated, some chromatic aberration top left corner in the snow. The shadows are a bit too dark to see any detail in them. Still good though!</td>', 'I had a 1,000 piece puzzle when I was younger with EXACTLY this scene! That tree hasnt grown in about 20 years. Nice shot but PP let you down a little. Blues look too oversaturated, some chromatic aberration top left corner in the snow. The shadows are a bit too dark to see any detail in them. Still good though!', '2011-02-16 13:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317007, 931515, 114233, '<td valign="top">I like the way the bokeh mimics the spots on Lady B. I wish I could see more of her face though especially the right hand side (our right) as its a bit dark.</td>', 'I like the way the bokeh mimics the spots on Lady B. I wish I could see more of her face though especially the right hand side (our right) as its a bit dark.', '2011-02-16 13:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317049, 930301, 124340, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!</td>', 'Very nice!!', '2011-02-16 13:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317058, 934219, 113591, '<td valign="top">nice contrasts - speed/sleep, public/private</td>', 'nice contrasts - speed/sleep, public/private', '2011-02-16 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317060, 934935, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow - fire in the sky and a perfect complement to the volcano! Love the bold and vibrant hues that ''erupt'' in the sky in the landscape shot featuring Mt. Fuji. There is also that great blanket of haze/fog that adds a layer of separation between the man-made landscape and that of nature''s landscape. Very nicely processed and captured.</td>', 'Wow - fire in the sky and a perfect complement to the volcano! Love the bold and vibrant hues that ''erupt'' in the sky in the landscape shot featuring Mt. Fuji. There is also that great blanket of haze/fog that adds a layer of separation between the man-made landscape and that of nature''s landscape. Very nicely processed and captured.', '2011-02-16 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317065, 930378, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely gritty crusty crustacean.  It''s remarkably beautiful, ain''t it?  The marks are just wonderful.  On my 2010 imaginary wall.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely gritty crusty crustacean.  It''s remarkably beautiful, ain''t it?  The marks are just wonderful.  On my 2010 imaginary wall.  Thank you.', '2011-02-16 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317066, 934748, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very cute kitten with wonderful big eyes just staring at us. Focus is great on the triangular face area (eyes, nose, mouth), but gets soft and blurred the further out. Love the detail I can see on the fur in the frontal portion of the face. I think the composition would be stronger if the rest of the head and body had the same great level of detail seen in the front portion of the face. A faster ISO and a high aperture (8 or above) would get that greater DOF.</td>', 'Very cute kitten with wonderful big eyes just staring at us. Focus is great on the triangular face area (eyes, nose, mouth), but gets soft and blurred the further out. Love the detail I can see on the fur in the frontal portion of the face. I think the composition would be stronger if the rest of the head and body had the same great level of detail seen in the front portion of the face. A faster ISO and a high aperture (8 or above) would get that greater DOF.', '2011-02-16 13:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317070, 935188, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yo'' mama told you?  Breathtaking composition; it clicks into place so inevitably  now that you have done it.  On my 2010 imaginary wall.  Thank you.</td>', 'Yo'' mama told you?  Breathtaking composition; it clicks into place so inevitably  now that you have done it.  On my 2010 imaginary wall.  Thank you.', '2011-02-16 13:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
