(6319831, 930905, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m always tempted to think that every image from San Diego is by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LevT</a>.  The excellent quality of this picture reinforces that notion.</td>', 'I''m always tempted to think that every image from San Diego is by  LevT.  The excellent quality of this picture reinforces that notion.', '2011-02-18 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
