(6319840, 934101, 96751, '<td valign="top">For a minute, I thought this must be the Bradbury building in LA.  It has SO many similarities.  But upon close inspection, it has an equal number of differences.  I wouldn''t be surprised if they were designed by the same architect.  Hope you''ll share the location city in your notes.</td>', 'For a minute, I thought this must be the Bradbury building in LA.  It has SO many similarities.  But upon close inspection, it has an equal number of differences.  I wouldn''t be surprised if they were designed by the same architect.  Hope you''ll share the location city in your notes.', '2011-02-18 11:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
