(6320332, 934774, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite inspired framing. Really quirky but also beautiful. I kind of wish the signage wasn''t there on the right.</td>', 'Quite inspired framing. Really quirky but also beautiful. I kind of wish the signage wasn''t there on the right.', '2011-02-18 21:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
