(6320365, 930103, 76335, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this brings to mind Barnett Newman. But it has a haptic quality more reminiscent of Tapies. It''s interesting that I should compare this to the work of painters, but, for that matter, this goes beyond photography. Maybe that''s the real challenge for the viewer -- appreciating this as a photograph. It''s an image that requires thought, meditation even -- and we just don''t do that here at DPC. <br/> <br/>Ten. Easily.</td>', 'The simplicity of this brings to mind Barnett Newman. But it has a haptic quality more reminiscent of Tapies. It''s interesting that I should compare this to the work of painters, but, for that matter, this goes beyond photography. Maybe that''s the real challenge for the viewer -- appreciating this as a photograph. It''s an image that requires thought, meditation even -- and we just don''t do that here at DPC.  Ten. Easily.', '2011-02-18 22:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320366, 932021, 76335, '<td valign="top">I see John Lennon in the moon...</td>', 'I see John Lennon in the moon...', '2011-02-18 22:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
