(6320769, 930515, 63218, '<td valign="top">They really are this white. It''s an interesting bit of humor, though, to desaturate the green leaves.</td>', 'They really are this white. It''s an interesting bit of humor, though, to desaturate the green leaves.', '2011-02-19 12:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320770, 930023, 76335, '<td valign="top">Leaving so much open space in the middle of this image was an inspired decision. It adds to the suspense, the anticipation. A blank canvas, the sky''s the limit, and all that. Nice.</td>', 'Leaving so much open space in the middle of this image was an inspired decision. It adds to the suspense, the anticipation. A blank canvas, the sky''s the limit, and all that. Nice.', '2011-02-19 12:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320771, 931953, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is a classic, very well done. Wondering how you got your camera angle.</td>', 'This is a classic, very well done. Wondering how you got your camera angle.', '2011-02-19 12:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320772, 932158, 63218, '<td valign="top">Classic beauty, very well done. I admire the subtle detail in the Lotus petals, the delicate color shading. And it''s so clean &amp; bright.</td>', 'Classic beauty, very well done. I admire the subtle detail in the Lotus petals, the delicate color shading. And it''s so clean & bright.', '2011-02-19 12:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320773, 930298, 208, '<td valign="top">Love the eye for the little details in this shot. This is something most people just don''t notice or would ever think of taking a picture of.</td>', 'Love the eye for the little details in this shot. This is something most people just don''t notice or would ever think of taking a picture of.', '2011-02-19 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320774, 931472, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful in all its simplicity.</td>', 'Quite beautiful in all its simplicity.', '2011-02-19 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320775, 935552, 63218, '<td valign="top">They grow in the shade under the trees &amp; it is so nice when they are struck by a stray sunbeam like this. The shadows are lovely. Good job.</td>', 'They grow in the shade under the trees & it is so nice when they are struck by a stray sunbeam like this. The shadows are lovely. Good job.', '2011-02-19 12:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320776, 931087, 63218, '<td valign="top">Kudos for a gorgeous background. The green vase is not bad, either. It all supports the lovely butter yellow of the sunflower petals beautifully. Especially in that light, which seems to be coming from a small window, high up, like a cell. This could be the Count of Monte Christ''s sunflower. Well done.</td>', 'Kudos for a gorgeous background. The green vase is not bad, either. It all supports the lovely butter yellow of the sunflower petals beautifully. Especially in that light, which seems to be coming from a small window, high up, like a cell. This could be the Count of Monte Christ''s sunflower. Well done.', '2011-02-19 12:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320777, 934962, 63218, '<td valign="top">Fascinating. Nicely controlled light. Instant fav.</td>', 'Fascinating. Nicely controlled light. Instant fav.', '2011-02-19 12:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320778, 934312, 63218, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder sometimes about the architects of stairs, what they think, how they think about it. I think this would please the architect.</td>', 'I have to wonder sometimes about the architects of stairs, what they think, how they think about it. I think this would please the architect.', '2011-02-19 12:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320779, 932167, 63218, '<td valign="top">Love the light, the point of view, the PP. Instant fav.</td>', 'Love the light, the point of view, the PP. Instant fav.', '2011-02-19 12:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320781, 935527, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like your PP here, very sweet &amp; spiky.</td>', 'I like your PP here, very sweet & spiky.', '2011-02-19 12:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320782, 935680, 208, '<td valign="top">This would be a pretty enough picture, but the two silhouetted figures add so much to what would otherwise be yet another picture of a sunset and time-lapse water movement. Well seen.</td>', 'This would be a pretty enough picture, but the two silhouetted figures add so much to what would otherwise be yet another picture of a sunset and time-lapse water movement. Well seen.', '2011-02-19 12:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
