(6320789, 934962, 208, '<td valign="top">Gross. And cool. I just wish that thing stood out more from the background. It loses quite a bit of <i>oomph</i> with the way it blends in with the rocks. (It''s basically the same color as the top center rock.)</td>', 'Gross. And cool. I just wish that thing stood out more from the background. It loses quite a bit of oomph with the way it blends in with the rocks. (It''s basically the same color as the top center rock.)', '2011-02-19 12:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
