(6320877, 935679, 76335, '<td valign="top">I see confetti but also deep scars. A contradiction, of course. And it''s that dissonance that keeps me staring at it. Trying to resolve it. But the beauty is that it resists such efforts. <br/> <br/>Ten.</td>', 'I see confetti but also deep scars. A contradiction, of course. And it''s that dissonance that keeps me staring at it. Trying to resolve it. But the beauty is that it resists such efforts.  Ten.', '2011-02-19 13:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
