(6321011, 932739, 19944, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you were trying to accomplish with the processing.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you were trying to accomplish with the processing.', '2011-02-19 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321012, 930413, 30861, '<td valign="top">The Jim Bean placard behind her drink is killing this for me, and so is the white sign on the wall. For this kind of shot, you gotta be in control of the details...</td>', 'The Jim Bean placard behind her drink is killing this for me, and so is the white sign on the wall. For this kind of shot, you gotta be in control of the details...', '2011-02-19 16:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321015, 934962, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What an arresting image - certainly not something you see everyday. The preciseness of your presentation of the skull, upon a table of rock, is very much in keeping with the positioned skulls of still-life tradition; but here with the natural backdrop and the uncompromising anatomy of the skull make our consideration of life and death all the more pronounced.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all<br/> <br/>Overall: I wouldn''t have it on my wall but I certainly can appreciate what you''ve made here.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What an arresting image - certainly not something you see everyday. The preciseness of your presentation of the skull, upon a table of rock, is very much in keeping with the positioned skulls of still-life tradition; but here with the natural backdrop and the uncompromising anatomy of the skull make our consideration of life and death all the more pronounced. Critical stuff: Nothing at all Overall: I wouldn''t have it on my wall but I certainly can appreciate what you''ve made here.', '2011-02-19 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321019, 934785, 19944, '<td valign="top">This feels over-processed to me</td>', 'This feels over-processed to me', '2011-02-19 16:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321020, 931206, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an automatic 10 from me.  I have often thought much the same thing as the fellow on the right, and for much the same reasons, when reading some of the rant threads here at DPC.  <br/> <br/>Your 10 is not just a bonus for your shock value BTW, it''s a considered judgement on the merits of the photograph as documentary art.  There is much more going on than just the ''joust-of-signs''; there is an accusing finger (ironically pointing at ''God''), and there is the gay kiss as well (amounting to another kind of finger).  And the ''PHOBIA'' t-shirt.  All of it contrasted with the serene ignorance of the perpetrator.</td>', 'This is an automatic 10 from me.  I have often thought much the same thing as the fellow on the right, and for much the same reasons, when reading some of the rant threads here at DPC.   Your 10 is not just a bonus for your shock value BTW, it''s a considered judgement on the merits of the photograph as documentary art.  There is much more going on than just the ''joust-of-signs''; there is an accusing finger (ironically pointing at ''God''), and there is the gay kiss as well (amounting to another kind of finger).  And the ''PHOBIA'' t-shirt.  All of it contrasted with the serene ignorance of the perpetrator.', '2011-02-19 16:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321025, 930378, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Beautiful and brave. The juxtaposition of the red crab claw against the very black volcanic sand is very effective. I love the texture of the sand to and how, where it reflects, black is actually white if we care to look hard enough. Your composition of the frame is exquisite.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Very high quality work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Beautiful and brave. The juxtaposition of the red crab claw against the very black volcanic sand is very effective. I love the texture of the sand to and how, where it reflects, black is actually white if we care to look hard enough. Your composition of the frame is exquisite. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Very high quality work.', '2011-02-19 16:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321026, 930008, 100393, '<td valign="top">"You mean these??"<br/> <br/>So makes me wonder what he just said to her.</td>', '"You mean these??" So makes me wonder what he just said to her.', '2011-02-19 16:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321030, 935188, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: An image of considerable power not least because the of the wrap-around continuation of form. The contrast in the headwear is stark and the flecks of precipitation makes us wonder about the weather and then the contrast between the figures becomes even more prominent..<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much at all - I''d like a tad more contrast but I suspect you then lose the rear figure''s face into the shadows of her hood.<br/> <br/>Overall: A well made image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: An image of considerable power not least because the of the wrap-around continuation of form. The contrast in the headwear is stark and the flecks of precipitation makes us wonder about the weather and then the contrast between the figures becomes even more prominent.. Critical stuff: Not much at all - I''d like a tad more contrast but I suspect you then lose the rear figure''s face into the shadows of her hood. Overall: A well made image.', '2011-02-19 17:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321031, 934145, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I liked this before I spotted the cat and then it really came alive! Also, once I do see the cat and have that anchor for my eye and brain I begin to wonder how you shot and achieved this... I have no answers though - is it simply reflections of trees in the glass that you''ve given a bit of a treatment to&gt;<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Highly intriguing and well crafted image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I liked this before I spotted the cat and then it really came alive! Also, once I do see the cat and have that anchor for my eye and brain I begin to wonder how you shot and achieved this... I have no answers though - is it simply reflections of trees in the glass that you''ve given a bit of a treatment to> Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Highly intriguing and well crafted image.', '2011-02-19 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321035, 933851, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Jennifer, this is a lovely image - I''ve seen it before - 1x? The serenity of the subject (your daughter) and the title lead the viewer to really believe her lungs are full of liquid. The complete neutrality of the picture lets us overlay our own scenarios - from mermaid to casualty. Of course the composition, the tones, the light are all super. Where were you when shooting this?<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Really interesting and well made work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Jennifer, this is a lovely image - I''ve seen it before - 1x? The serenity of the subject (your daughter) and the title lead the viewer to really believe her lungs are full of liquid. The complete neutrality of the picture lets us overlay our own scenarios - from mermaid to casualty. Of course the composition, the tones, the light are all super. Where were you when shooting this? Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Really interesting and well made work.', '2011-02-19 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321037, 933583, 19944, '<td valign="top">Ansel?  Is that you?</td>', 'Ansel?  Is that you?', '2011-02-19 17:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321038, 935339, 76335, '<td valign="top">Sunshine on a cloudy day. Her top says something about kisses which is a nice, if mostly hidden, detail. All the more reason to view it large. Really good.</td>', 'Sunshine on a cloudy day. Her top says something about kisses which is a nice, if mostly hidden, detail. All the more reason to view it large. Really good.', '2011-02-19 17:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321042, 934219, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: There is something about this simple scene that just stops me in my tracks - it is so beautifully captured, so honest, so lacking in fuss, so everyday, so slice-of-life. There is beauty in that simplicity - I overwork my images to near death so I feel I have learnt something just by looking at this. It is really transportive too - I feel like I am there.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Lovely, subtle, even masterful shot.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: There is something about this simple scene that just stops me in my tracks - it is so beautifully captured, so honest, so lacking in fuss, so everyday, so slice-of-life. There is beauty in that simplicity - I overwork my images to near death so I feel I have learnt something just by looking at this. It is really transportive too - I feel like I am there. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Lovely, subtle, even masterful shot.', '2011-02-19 17:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321045, 932876, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. I think I must bump it a point.</td>', 'This is stunning. I think I must bump it a point.', '2011-02-19 17:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321046, 935644, 76335, '<td valign="top">Like being inside the womb. Captivating.</td>', 'Like being inside the womb. Captivating.', '2011-02-19 17:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321047, 935469, 76335, '<td valign="top">The dark foreground branches add wonderful counterpoint to the distant clouds and mountains. A study in fractals. Very nice.</td>', 'The dark foreground branches add wonderful counterpoint to the distant clouds and mountains. A study in fractals. Very nice.', '2011-02-19 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321048, 935581, 76335, '<td valign="top">A very stylish and revealing portrait.</td>', 'A very stylish and revealing portrait.', '2011-02-19 17:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321053, 932369, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful layers, of course. The textured foreground really sets it into motion.</td>', 'Wonderful layers, of course. The textured foreground really sets it into motion.', '2011-02-19 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321054, 935213, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice management of difficult back lighting.</td>', 'Nice management of difficult back lighting.', '2011-02-19 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321055, 930087, 76335, '<td valign="top">Simply stated, beautifully composed.</td>', 'Simply stated, beautifully composed.', '2011-02-19 17:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321056, 935650, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s poetry on fire. Nice work.</td>', 'It''s poetry on fire. Nice work.', '2011-02-19 17:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321057, 931948, 60047, '<td valign="top">A nice rendition of a familiar photo subject.</td>', 'A nice rendition of a familiar photo subject.', '2011-02-19 17:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321058, 933111, 76335, '<td valign="top">One to print and frame, for sure.</td>', 'One to print and frame, for sure.', '2011-02-19 17:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321060, 935402, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Really lovely shot with very brave bold toning - I like that. The clarity of the top of the tree works really well when placed against the misty backdrop. The painter below the canopy transform the image from a fairly vanilla landscape into something almost cinematic. I want to know what those structures are on the other side of the tree.... to leave this ambiguous ads to the image. I''d have cloned them out - you were right to keep then in.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The bush to the right - I use my hand to crop the image just to the left and the whole image seems more polished to me.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nicely made.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Really lovely shot with very brave bold toning - I like that. The clarity of the top of the tree works really well when placed against the misty backdrop. The painter below the canopy transform the image from a fairly vanilla landscape into something almost cinematic. I want to know what those structures are on the other side of the tree.... to leave this ambiguous ads to the image. I''d have cloned them out - you were right to keep then in. Critical stuff: The bush to the right - I use my hand to crop the image just to the left and the whole image seems more polished to me. Overall: Very nicely made.', '2011-02-19 17:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321062, 930064, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful the way it swirls its way into focus.</td>', 'Wonderful the way it swirls its way into focus.', '2011-02-19 17:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321063, 935713, 76335, '<td valign="top">Casual yet intimate and revealing. Looks like natural light (?) which is always nice to see.</td>', 'Casual yet intimate and revealing. Looks like natural light (?) which is always nice to see.', '2011-02-19 17:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321064, 934861, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good fiction. Nicely composed and executed.</td>', 'Good fiction. Nicely composed and executed.', '2011-02-19 17:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321066, 934728, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s hard not to like these shadows. Kind of wish your subject weren''t walking away.</td>', 'It''s hard not to like these shadows. Kind of wish your subject weren''t walking away.', '2011-02-19 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321068, 935530, 76335, '<td valign="top">Indeed, though it strikes me as being more about the eyes (and you must have though so yourself in that they are selectively saturated). Good in any case.</td>', 'Indeed, though it strikes me as being more about the eyes (and you must have though so yourself in that they are selectively saturated). Good in any case.', '2011-02-19 17:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321069, 932272, 60047, '<td valign="top">The horses and riders do so much to lend a sense of size and perspective to this shot . The blues of the riders are popping out quite strongly.</td>', 'The horses and riders do so much to lend a sense of size and perspective to this shot . The blues of the riders are popping out quite strongly.', '2011-02-19 17:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321070, 933877, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like it, although the foreground activity (cars and people) is hard to make out. Maybe you''re too far away.</td>', 'I like it, although the foreground activity (cars and people) is hard to make out. Maybe you''re too far away.', '2011-02-19 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321071, 935289, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great texture detail. Nice use of b&amp;w. The centered composition of the tunnel is offset nicely by the positioning of the person.</td>', 'Great texture detail. Nice use of b&w. The centered composition of the tunnel is offset nicely by the positioning of the person.', '2011-02-19 17:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321072, 935631, 76335, '<td valign="top">Must bump this a point. There''s something about the mood here that feels transitive -- like his momentary joy is about to erupt into a tantrum as a result of the restraint. Good.</td>', 'Must bump this a point. There''s something about the mood here that feels transitive -- like his momentary joy is about to erupt into a tantrum as a result of the restraint. Good.', '2011-02-19 17:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321073, 933521, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great technicals on this shot. I especially like the fact that you can see the face of the pilot.</td>', 'Great technicals on this shot. I especially like the fact that you can see the face of the pilot.', '2011-02-19 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321074, 935640, 76335, '<td valign="top">The lighting goes a long way to show off the excellent fractal forms here.</td>', 'The lighting goes a long way to show off the excellent fractal forms here.', '2011-02-19 17:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321075, 934514, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Larry, I like a number of elements in this image, the clarity of the signs in particular and the dominance of the Sean Combs billboard. The toning is excellent too - you have contrast in all the right places.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I don''t think this is as powerful as your October Free Study entry - the inclusion of the heads detracts from the image for me - I liked the other because it felt like I had just been helped to look up, to notice things.... Here I feel more like on of the masses... head forward, eyes down, move forward.<br/> <br/>Overall: Nice, but for, it doesn''t compare favourably with the other image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Larry, I like a number of elements in this image, the clarity of the signs in particular and the dominance of the Sean Combs billboard. The toning is excellent too - you have contrast in all the right places. Critical stuff: I don''t think this is as powerful as your October Free Study entry - the inclusion of the heads detracts from the image for me - I liked the other because it felt like I had just been helped to look up, to notice things.... Here I feel more like on of the masses... head forward, eyes down, move forward. Overall: Nice, but for, it doesn''t compare favourably with the other image.', '2011-02-19 17:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321077, 930087, 60047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and evocative.</td>', 'Beautiful and evocative.', '2011-02-19 17:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321078, 931597, 76335, '<td valign="top">I always wondered for whom the bells tolled. Now I know.</td>', 'I always wondered for whom the bells tolled. Now I know.', '2011-02-19 17:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321079, 935681, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot - I want to be there!</td>', 'This is a great shot - I want to be there!', '2011-02-19 17:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321082, 934779, 76335, '<td valign="top">Chilling, really. Like an apparition.</td>', 'Chilling, really. Like an apparition.', '2011-02-19 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6321083, 932331, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Fantastic light you have here and your editing has made the most of it. A nice moment captured - I can almost feel the child''s excitement from here. Your decision to use a vignette was, in my opinion, inspired - it really, really suits the image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Perhaps it need straightening a touch?<br/> <br/>Overall: I really like this.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Fantastic light you have here and your editing has made the most of it. A nice moment captured - I can almost feel the child''s excitement from here. Your decision to use a vignette was, in my opinion, inspired - it really, really suits the image. Critical stuff: Perhaps it need straightening a touch? Overall: I really like this.', '2011-02-19 17:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
