(6322057, 932694, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great pose. Nice higher key shot. But the exposure seems to be more balanced for the black shirt rather than the face and hat. I would think this would be even better if you brought the exposure down a bit. You might lose detail in the black but you would gain it in the face and hat.</td>', 'Great pose. Nice higher key shot. But the exposure seems to be more balanced for the black shirt rather than the face and hat. I would think this would be even better if you brought the exposure down a bit. You might lose detail in the black but you would gain it in the face and hat.', '2011-02-20 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322059, 933842, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great pose captured.</td>', 'Great pose captured.', '2011-02-20 12:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
