(6322240, 934962, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! What a find. Both gross and fascinating. It looks like what is left of the animal''s nostril is twisted around on it''s skull. This suggests to me that is was devoured by a predator. Glad you took a risk with this one and didn''t play it safe with something more acceptable. My highest vote so far in this challenge.</td>', 'Oh wow! What a find. Both gross and fascinating. It looks like what is left of the animal''s nostril is twisted around on it''s skull. This suggests to me that is was devoured by a predator. Glad you took a risk with this one and didn''t play it safe with something more acceptable. My highest vote so far in this challenge.', '2011-02-20 13:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322241, 934312, 60047, '<td valign="top">A great architectural/perspective shot.</td>', 'A great architectural/perspective shot.', '2011-02-20 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322243, 933779, 83313, '<td valign="top">This would look great frames on the wall. Wonderful.</td>', 'This would look great frames on the wall. Wonderful.', '2011-02-20 13:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322244, 930924, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bryce is adorably tiny in that big landscape.  Foreground looks like it needs a little white balance adjustment (too cyan on my monitor) and overall image looks like it could use a contrast boost below the sky.</td>', 'Bryce is adorably tiny in that big landscape.  Foreground looks like it needs a little white balance adjustment (too cyan on my monitor) and overall image looks like it could use a contrast boost below the sky.', '2011-02-20 13:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322245, 932401, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice colors - especially in the dragonfly''s contrast with the BG. I wish there was more DOF so that the red part was in focus.</td>', 'Nice colors - especially in the dragonfly''s contrast with the BG. I wish there was more DOF so that the red part was in focus.', '2011-02-20 13:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322248, 934137, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like Flag lake. The high key look does nicely for it.</td>', 'Looks like Flag lake. The high key look does nicely for it.', '2011-02-20 13:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322249, 934972, 60047, '<td valign="top">A really nice concept behind the shot. Noticeably blown out on the right. I wonder if converting to B&amp;W might do better to hide this and save the shot?</td>', 'A really nice concept behind the shot. Noticeably blown out on the right. I wonder if converting to B&W might do better to hide this and save the shot?', '2011-02-20 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322250, 935670, 65234, '<td valign="top">I suppose they could be titans in relation to something even smaller ;-)  Like the composition and DOF.</td>', 'I suppose they could be titans in relation to something even smaller ;-)  Like the composition and DOF.', '2011-02-20 13:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322251, 935415, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the light cooperates perfectly!</td>', 'Sometimes the light cooperates perfectly!', '2011-02-20 13:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322252, 934719, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a very powerful creature.  Not one I''d like to make angry!</td>', 'Looks to be a very powerful creature.  Not one I''d like to make angry!', '2011-02-20 13:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322253, 935603, 60047, '<td valign="top">Almost postcard worthy.<br/> <br/>Great composition. I would like to see more sharpness on the light house structures.</td>', 'Almost postcard worthy. Great composition. I would like to see more sharpness on the light house structures.', '2011-02-20 13:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322254, 931076, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the light!</td>', 'Love the light!', '2011-02-20 13:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322255, 932807, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract work. Like it a lot. I''m curious about what it really is, but that knowledge might ruin part of the magic.</td>', 'Very cool abstract work. Like it a lot. I''m curious about what it really is, but that knowledge might ruin part of the magic.', '2011-02-20 13:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322256, 933111, 60047, '<td valign="top">What an interesting expression. Not bad management for such harsh lighting conditions.</td>', 'What an interesting expression. Not bad management for such harsh lighting conditions.', '2011-02-20 13:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322257, 930622, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures in this shot.</td>', 'Great colors and textures in this shot.', '2011-02-20 13:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322258, 930620, 60047, '<td valign="top">I agree with the girl parking the bike - what''s with that dude?</td>', 'I agree with the girl parking the bike - what''s with that dude?', '2011-02-20 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322259, 932158, 60047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Just enough DOF to retain sharpness where it is needed.</td>', 'Beautiful. Just enough DOF to retain sharpness where it is needed.', '2011-02-20 13:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322260, 934213, 25773, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp.</td>', 'Nice and crisp.', '2011-02-20 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322261, 933245, 60047, '<td valign="top">Damn, what a shot!</td>', 'Damn, what a shot!', '2011-02-20 13:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6322262, 934685, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sweet moment!  There''s a rock or something else light right above mama''s forehead; I think I''d clone that out.</td>', 'Sweet moment!  There''s a rock or something else light right above mama''s forehead; I think I''d clone that out.', '2011-02-20 13:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
