(6322406, 930087, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great balance and serenity in this photo. The moon adds an extra point of interest the keeps the eye looking a bit longer.</td>', 'Great balance and serenity in this photo. The moon adds an extra point of interest the keeps the eye looking a bit longer.', '2011-02-20 15:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
