(6323951, 932536, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fiora:</b></div><hr/><i>I am super super disappointed with how this scored. Its a huge downer.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ahhh yes, i know the feeling well. i had a free study entry once that scored in the 5''s and i was so irritated that i posted a rant in the description in which i swore off free studies forever, obviously that didn''t last long. Dont let it get you too down. your score is not so much what people thought of your picture but the competition that surrounded it. think of all the amazing photographers on this site, they all get to pick from ANY shot they took during the year that didn''t get into a challenge! it''s pretty hard for any of us. keep shooting, you are improving all the time since you came here!</td>', 'Originally posted by fiora:I am super super disappointed with how this scored. Its a huge downer.  ahhh yes, i know the feeling well. i had a free study entry once that scored in the 5''s and i was so irritated that i posted a rant in the description in which i swore off free studies forever, obviously that didn''t last long. Dont let it get you too down. your score is not so much what people thought of your picture but the competition that surrounded it. think of all the amazing photographers on this site, they all get to pick from ANY shot they took during the year that didn''t get into a challenge! it''s pretty hard for any of us. keep shooting, you are improving all the time since you came here!', '2011-02-21 02:16:46.000000', NULL, 0),
