(6324047, 935413, 114233, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the acknowledgement Rian. It was more than a pleasure to help where I could. It feels like I made the top 10 too even though I didnt enter this challenge :-).<br/>This was also a great learning curve for me and Im sure the new editing knowledge will be of great benefit to the both of us for the future. Glad it did well! Congrats!</td>', 'Thanks for the acknowledgement Rian. It was more than a pleasure to help where I could. It feels like I made the top 10 too even though I didnt enter this challenge :-).This was also a great learning curve for me and Im sure the new editing knowledge will be of great benefit to the both of us for the future. Glad it did well! Congrats!', '2011-02-21 03:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
