(6324057, 935385, 114233, '<td valign="top">I am very surprised this didnt do better. It wa smy highest vote. It is a lovely shot and you can really get the feeling that you are right there in the cold. You should be proud to have this in your portfolio! I''m glad you found my comment useful and hope it helps you in the future too.</td>', 'I am very surprised this didnt do better. It wa smy highest vote. It is a lovely shot and you can really get the feeling that you are right there in the cold. You should be proud to have this in your portfolio! I''m glad you found my comment useful and hope it helps you in the future too.', '2011-02-21 03:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324058, 932534, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m quite surprised this didn''t fare better. As you say, it''s other-worldly. I have you an 8, and in retrospect it should have been a 9...</td>', 'I''m quite surprised this didn''t fare better. As you say, it''s other-worldly. I have you an 8, and in retrospect it should have been a 9...', '2011-02-21 03:48:16.000000', NULL, 0),
