(6324262, 932696, 108069, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the great score and top finish. First the best of the month and now the year from the same shoot. Nice work. I disagree about it not being eye candy, though. It most certainly is. I''d love to know what shutter speed you used to get this shot. Not that I find myself around surfers often, but when I am I want to be ready.</td>', 'Congrats on the great score and top finish. First the best of the month and now the year from the same shoot. Nice work. I disagree about it not being eye candy, though. It most certainly is. I''d love to know what shutter speed you used to get this shot. Not that I find myself around surfers often, but when I am I want to be ready.', '2011-02-21 07:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
