(6324280, 935580, 43463, '<td valign="top">Hey there neighbor (commenting on those above and below my entries)! Congrats on the high placement (top 25%) Kevin! Very lovely photo - the soft pastel colors are stunning and the ''starry'' lights leading up to the lighthouse make me think of stars in the night sky. The pathway is a nice leading line that draws our attention to the lighthouse even more.</td>', 'Hey there neighbor (commenting on those above and below my entries)! Congrats on the high placement (top 25%) Kevin! Very lovely photo - the soft pastel colors are stunning and the ''starry'' lights leading up to the lighthouse make me think of stars in the night sky. The pathway is a nice leading line that draws our attention to the lighthouse even more.', '2011-02-21 08:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324282, 934137, 60047, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be yours...congrats on a great rendition of this shot, Ken.</td>', 'I thought this might be yours...congrats on a great rendition of this shot, Ken.', '2011-02-21 08:09:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324285, 932245, 43463, '<td valign="top">Hello neighbor (commenting on those above and below my entries)! There is such wonderful detail in the fur and horn of the ram! As added visual bonus there is rain that makes this shot interesting. Now that I think upon it, is it truly rain or is it beginning to snow? Regardless, the feel it adds to the shot is that it is a cold and blustery day.</td>', 'Hello neighbor (commenting on those above and below my entries)! There is such wonderful detail in the fur and horn of the ram! As added visual bonus there is rain that makes this shot interesting. Now that I think upon it, is it truly rain or is it beginning to snow? Regardless, the feel it adds to the shot is that it is a cold and blustery day.', '2011-02-21 08:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324286, 933358, 16739, '<td valign="top">really cool effect</td>', 'really cool effect', '2011-02-21 08:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324289, 932696, 121004, '<td valign="top">Well deserved Blue. Amazing amazing shot...</td>', 'Well deserved Blue. Amazing amazing shot...', '2011-02-21 08:19:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324290, 935003, 108069, '<td valign="top">Hi, you asked for advice, so I''m going to act like I can give some. First off, I don''t know why people think the footprint is raised. Must be some sort of optical illusion.<br/> <br/>Technically it is perfect and there''s nothing to improve upon regarding focus, depth of field, sharpness, exposure, etc. The only thing I would maybe alter is the composition, slightly. I would have the footprint located about where you do, on a third crossing, but leading into the scene instead of out of it. I would also try to get the shoreline to the top third, not slicing the scene roughly in half as it is. And maybe a lower perspective to get more of the sea (and maybe some horizon, if interesting) to get a slight feeling of where these footprints get washed to.<br/> <br/>But these aren''t criticisms, just what I would have done with it, and only shared because you asked. Obviously this is as tough as the competition gets, and your high score proves just how good a photo this is. Nice work.</td>', 'Hi, you asked for advice, so I''m going to act like I can give some. First off, I don''t know why people think the footprint is raised. Must be some sort of optical illusion. Technically it is perfect and there''s nothing to improve upon regarding focus, depth of field, sharpness, exposure, etc. The only thing I would maybe alter is the composition, slightly. I would have the footprint located about where you do, on a third crossing, but leading into the scene instead of out of it. I would also try to get the shoreline to the top third, not slicing the scene roughly in half as it is. And maybe a lower perspective to get more of the sea (and maybe some horizon, if interesting) to get a slight feeling of where these footprints get washed to. But these aren''t criticisms, just what I would have done with it, and only shared because you asked. Obviously this is as tough as the competition gets, and your high score proves just how good a photo this is. Nice work.', '2011-02-21 08:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324291, 932007, 19944, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What is this doing way down here?<br/> <br/>This is absolutely stunning in my book.</td>', 'Wow.  What is this doing way down here? This is absolutely stunning in my book.', '2011-02-21 08:31:27.000000', NULL, 0),
