(6324488, 930413, 100831, '<td valign="top">by nice I mean I like it and I don''t often comment on the model poses (nor, obviously, do I take them so coming from me is different than what some of the ofther professionals might tell you).<br/>But to me the lighting is perfect, the dof works, the composition is excellent and it''s very tasteful. I''m surprised this didn''t do better.</td>', 'by nice I mean I like it and I don''t often comment on the model poses (nor, obviously, do I take them so coming from me is different than what some of the ofther professionals might tell you).But to me the lighting is perfect, the dof works, the composition is excellent and it''s very tasteful. I''m surprised this didn''t do better.', '2011-02-21 10:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
