(6324491, 934723, 30982, '<td valign="top">The word that popped into my head when I voted this one was "gentle" - there''s an overarching sense of gentleness and peacefulness thoughout this photo.  The careful way they''re paddling, the careful way they seem to be sitting.  The softness of the light touching the leaves just across the way.  And none of this would carry in color, I don''t think - black and white is perfect.  An excellent memory!</td>', 'The word that popped into my head when I voted this one was "gentle" - there''s an overarching sense of gentleness and peacefulness thoughout this photo.  The careful way they''re paddling, the careful way they seem to be sitting.  The softness of the light touching the leaves just across the way.  And none of this would carry in color, I don''t think - black and white is perfect.  An excellent memory!', '2011-02-21 11:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324498, 934198, 5585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful one Denis...</td>', 'Beautiful one Denis...', '2011-02-21 11:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324499, 935580, 19944, '<td valign="top">An 8 from me.  I''m a sucker for lighthouses.<br/> <br/>the clarity and colors on this are spot on, and I, too am wonder what it is doing down this far.<br/> <br/>If I had to pick one thing to quibble about, it would be the loss of detail in the pier.  But, I had to look for something......</td>', 'An 8 from me.  I''m a sucker for lighthouses. the clarity and colors on this are spot on, and I, too am wonder what it is doing down this far. If I had to pick one thing to quibble about, it would be the loss of detail in the pier.  But, I had to look for something......', '2011-02-21 11:12:43.000000', NULL, 0),
