(6324751, 934219, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lev, I spent quite a while looking at the other entries again after the results were posted and, as inevitably happens, other commenters revealed wonderful things that I had either missed or underestimated.  But none of it has changed my view that this is the Best of 2010.  I hope that some of the people who didn''t rate it highly and have returned to take another peek may re-evaluate not your photograph, but rather themselves.  To be indifferent to this is to be aesthetically anesthetized.</td>', 'Lev, I spent quite a while looking at the other entries again after the results were posted and, as inevitably happens, other commenters revealed wonderful things that I had either missed or underestimated.  But none of it has changed my view that this is the Best of 2010.  I hope that some of the people who didn''t rate it highly and have returned to take another peek may re-evaluate not your photograph, but rather themselves.  To be indifferent to this is to be aesthetically anesthetized.', '2011-02-21 12:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324755, 932696, 3746, '<td valign="top">Truely incredible shot.. Working from left to right this image has everything, colour, composition, great light, action, great subject.. Not eyecandy? You jest surely?<br/> <br/>Well done J.<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'Truely incredible shot.. Working from left to right this image has everything, colour, composition, great light, action, great subject.. Not eyecandy? You jest surely? Well done J. M', '2011-02-21 12:32:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324847, 935713, 68020, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 9''s below...I really like this picture, sad to see it at 322</td>', 'I was one of your 9''s below...I really like this picture, sad to see it at 322', '2011-02-21 12:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324865, 932696, 116574, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Blue. Great Shot.<br/></td>', 'Congrats on your Blue. Great Shot.', '2011-02-21 13:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324908, 933851, 117474, '<td valign="top">The title really ties this together. Absolutely superb.</td>', 'The title really ties this together. Absolutely superb.', '2011-02-21 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324914, 935148, 108069, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful image that requires a bit of time to soak up the serenity, the graceful movement, the near symmetrical mirror of tones. Maybe too much to hope for in a challenge of 426 entries. I guess that might explain a bunch of the fives, but how this registered 19 sub-four votes is beyond me. Regardless, save this good stuff for the next DPL. ; )</td>', 'It''s a beautiful image that requires a bit of time to soak up the serenity, the graceful movement, the near symmetrical mirror of tones. Maybe too much to hope for in a challenge of 426 entries. I guess that might explain a bunch of the fives, but how this registered 19 sub-four votes is beyond me. Regardless, save this good stuff for the next DPL. ; )', '2011-02-21 13:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324920, 932696, 27608, '<td valign="top">Again, such an awesome shot!  Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Again, such an awesome shot!  Congrats on the blue!', '2011-02-21 13:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324921, 934137, 33361, '<td valign="top">Congrats! A lovely image!</td>', 'Congrats! A lovely image!', '2011-02-21 13:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
