(6324943, 935687, 61961, '<td valign="top">Love it, Deb.  A photo that lets the viewer create stories.  The black and white seems integral, too.</td>', 'Love it, Deb.  A photo that lets the viewer create stories.  The black and white seems integral, too.', '2011-02-21 13:36:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324951, 932536, 103142, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 7, but I think there are many reasons this didn''t score as high as the others.<br/> <br/>The crop on the feet is uncomfortable. There''s a horizon drawn on this one, I think that detracts. And the snail just isn''t as impressive as a dragon or cats and dogs. I like you others so much better, but I still found it worth a 7.</td>', 'I gave it a 7, but I think there are many reasons this didn''t score as high as the others. The crop on the feet is uncomfortable. There''s a horizon drawn on this one, I think that detracts. And the snail just isn''t as impressive as a dragon or cats and dogs. I like you others so much better, but I still found it worth a 7.', '2011-02-21 13:42:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324952, 932876, 17507, '<td valign="top">Gave you a 9 on this one. There are so many photos like this that try to be this good.</td>', 'Gave you a 9 on this one. There are so many photos like this that try to be this good.', '2011-02-21 13:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324954, 934514, 103142, '<td valign="top">I gave this one an 8. I do wish you saw more of the people, though. The crop is just a tad uncomfortable. But it was an 8 from me.</td>', 'I gave this one an 8. I do wish you saw more of the people, though. The crop is just a tad uncomfortable. But it was an 8 from me.', '2011-02-21 13:43:23.000000', NULL, 0),
