(6324967, 934719, 113419, '<td valign="top">WOWZERS!!!!!  I''m sorry I missed this one during voting it would have gotten a 10 from me.  This is postively MAGNIFCENT!  What an AWESOME piece of work. <br/>And a nod to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> for putting it in the Fantasy Art Gallery.  I might not have ever seen this one had I not spotted in posthumous thread.  It''s stunning  :-)  And now to mark it as a fav!</td>', 'WOWZERS!!!!!  I''m sorry I missed this one during voting it would have gotten a 10 from me.  This is postively MAGNIFCENT!  What an AWESOME piece of work. And a nod to  posthumous for putting it in the Fantasy Art Gallery.  I might not have ever seen this one had I not spotted in posthumous thread.  It''s stunning  :-)  And now to mark it as a fav!', '2011-02-21 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324994, 934148, 61315, '<td valign="top">Hi Scott, Such a well done image, very painterly and definitely worth more than the 6.0 it received. Like many, I''m frequently disappointed by some of the voting here and the final score and placement of some very nice images.<br/> <br/>BTW - I loved that movie! :-)</td>', 'Hi Scott, Such a well done image, very painterly and definitely worth more than the 6.0 it received. Like many, I''m frequently disappointed by some of the voting here and the final score and placement of some very nice images. BTW - I loved that movie! :-)', '2011-02-21 14:13:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324998, 935643, 100831, '<td valign="top">On my first viewing it appeared too dark and the whites too white. But together with the poem, which I didn''t know, it''s just perfect - in fact rather luminous.</td>', 'On my first viewing it appeared too dark and the whites too white. But together with the poem, which I didn''t know, it''s just perfect - in fact rather luminous.', '2011-02-21 14:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
