(6325074, 935519, 128166, '<td valign="top">This is a strong image. I love the look on her face and I love how you composed it. The kid is central, the lines in the image are great also because they direct you to the kid. This shows that portraits are also about the context, not just about shooting someone nicely. Well done!</td>', 'This is a strong image. I love the look on her face and I love how you composed it. The kid is central, the lines in the image are great also because they direct you to the kid. This shows that portraits are also about the context, not just about shooting someone nicely. Well done!', '2011-02-21 15:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
