(6325156, 932990, 60173, '<td valign="top">Do I like the border? No, not really. Do I like the image? Yes! I think it''s incredibly creative and very well executed. The lighting and colors are wonderful, and the lens distortion is playful.<br/> <br/>I don''t currently do portraits, but I''m starting to feel a draw to them. I''m doing some family portraits soon for some friends, and have a wedding for a friend coming up in July. Photos like this are a true inspiration in creativity. For years I''ve known that the best photos of kids are down at their level, and this is an excellent reminder of that.</td>', 'Do I like the border? No, not really. Do I like the image? Yes! I think it''s incredibly creative and very well executed. The lighting and colors are wonderful, and the lens distortion is playful. I don''t currently do portraits, but I''m starting to feel a draw to them. I''m doing some family portraits soon for some friends, and have a wedding for a friend coming up in July. Photos like this are a true inspiration in creativity. For years I''ve known that the best photos of kids are down at their level, and this is an excellent reminder of that.', '2011-02-21 16:04:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6325194, 932704, 124875, '<td valign="top">Thank you everybody!<br/>When I chose this photo, I was almost sure that it wasn''t a good choice for a contest. Yes, it lacks "wow factor", as one of you told me. But I love it!<br/>CNovack, I tried to crop as you suggests, but the result wasn''t satisfactory at all. I like that one can see that the boy is sitting on his father''s shoulders.<br/> <br/>Bye<br/> <br/>Guido<br/></td>', 'Thank you everybody!When I chose this photo, I was almost sure that it wasn''t a good choice for a contest. Yes, it lacks "wow factor", as one of you told me. But I love it!CNovack, I tried to crop as you suggests, but the result wasn''t satisfactory at all. I like that one can see that the boy is sitting on his father''s shoulders. Bye Guido', '2011-02-21 16:19:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6325195, 932696, 124982, '<td valign="top">Was the water truly this color, or is that more a product of the PP?</td>', 'Was the water truly this color, or is that more a product of the PP?', '2011-02-21 16:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
