(6325210, 933851, 124875, '<td valign="top">11th place: very good... but in my opinion it deserved an even better placement!<br/>I gave this photo a 9 (in four contests I haven''t given a single 10), because I find that it''s wonderful (and, of course, well done) and very, very unusual. It reminds me that famous scene from "The piano" when she slowly went down under the water...</td>', '11th place: very good... but in my opinion it deserved an even better placement!I gave this photo a 9 (in four contests I haven''t given a single 10), because I find that it''s wonderful (and, of course, well done) and very, very unusual. It reminds me that famous scene from "The piano" when she slowly went down under the water...', '2011-02-21 16:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
