(6326584, 930015, 92577, '<td valign="top">Hi Mike,<br/>First of all, good shot and nice processing. I remember during voting I scrolled the screen up to hide the shop fronts and just leave the bench in view. <br/> <br/>Reading in your comments about your ''mojo'' I wondered if you were a member of a local camera club. I am  and there are some people there who would suggest making a whole series of pictures about that wavy seat in your picture. For instance, one-a-week showing different styles, techniques and perspectives;  and/or the changing seasons, weather and the different types people who make use of it. But that''s camera clubs for you!<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>David</td>', 'Hi Mike,First of all, good shot and nice processing. I remember during voting I scrolled the screen up to hide the shop fronts and just leave the bench in view.  Reading in your comments about your ''mojo'' I wondered if you were a member of a local camera club. I am  and there are some people there who would suggest making a whole series of pictures about that wavy seat in your picture. For instance, one-a-week showing different styles, techniques and perspectives;  and/or the changing seasons, weather and the different types people who make use of it. But that''s camera clubs for you! CheersDavid', '2011-02-22 13:31:54.000000', NULL, 0),
