(6328723, 935068, 72103, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> congrats!<br/>curious what time of day this was.  I am going in the fall!  cant wait.<br/>thanks </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi, it was early in morning.  ABout 7:30 from memory ( I could always check the EXIF I guess ).  They reckon the sunset is cool in March-April.  This was October.  We also went back at night.  It''s far far far busier, I didnt think the light was anywhere as good.</td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: congrats!curious what time of day this was.  I am going in the fall!  cant wait.thanks   Hi, it was early in morning.  ABout 7:30 from memory ( I could always check the EXIF I guess ).  They reckon the sunset is cool in March-April.  This was October.  We also went back at night.  It''s far far far busier, I didnt think the light was anywhere as good.', '2011-02-23 11:41:04.000000', NULL, 0),
