(6330814, 931037, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great title and capture. The Hollywood sign is a bonus. You really captured his personality, maybe you should step out of your comfort zone more often! (Do what I do...use a long lens.)  I, also, agree with the "tilt-more or straighten" comment.<br/> <br/>I just realized this is minimal editing...disregard the tilt-more comment...:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-02-24 10:47:32.</i></td>', 'Great title and capture. The Hollywood sign is a bonus. You really captured his personality, maybe you should step out of your comfort zone more often! (Do what I do...use a long lens.)  I, also, agree with the "tilt-more or straighten" comment. I just realized this is minimal editing...disregard the tilt-more comment...:)', '2011-02-24 10:34:32.000000', '2011-02-24 10:47:32.000000', 0),
