(6332692, 930023, 113900, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant.  One of my favorite portraits I have ever seen on this site.  She has the beauty of a model but your composition and treatment of her in this shot conveys a much more human image than that of the normal portrait of a beautiful woman.<br/> <br/>Other things I love about this capture: The bird.  The sun shining from just outside the frame.  To me it conveys a feeling that she is not quite to her goals but that she is on her way and she is looking at it head on.  I also think the clouds and the sky give it an etherial feel that is just brilliant.  Excellent PP as well.  It is plain to see that this shot was done by  a professional who cares deeply about the art of Photography.<br/> <br/>I would also like to admit that I am deeply jealous that I have neither the eye, nor the talent to pull of such an amazing portrait.  Maybe someday, I hope.</td>', 'This is brilliant.  One of my favorite portraits I have ever seen on this site.  She has the beauty of a model but your composition and treatment of her in this shot conveys a much more human image than that of the normal portrait of a beautiful woman. Other things I love about this capture: The bird.  The sun shining from just outside the frame.  To me it conveys a feeling that she is not quite to her goals but that she is on her way and she is looking at it head on.  I also think the clouds and the sky give it an etherial feel that is just brilliant.  Excellent PP as well.  It is plain to see that this shot was done by  a professional who cares deeply about the art of Photography. I would also like to admit that I am deeply jealous that I have neither the eye, nor the talent to pull of such an amazing portrait.  Maybe someday, I hope.', '2011-02-26 01:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
