(6431688, 933251, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very interesting light, perhaps the best thing about this photo is that we see it from the fringe; we are using the peripheral vision, we are forced to look away not by what is in the frame but what is not; when you look at the door, you focus there but your gaze wanders to the outsides; brilliant.</td>', 'Very interesting light, perhaps the best thing about this photo is that we see it from the fringe; we are using the peripheral vision, we are forced to look away not by what is in the frame but what is not; when you look at the door, you focus there but your gaze wanders to the outsides; brilliant.', '2011-06-02 09:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6442830, 933539, 12611, '<td valign="top">beautiful valley shot; the fore ground lighting and middle distance shading, coupled with the distant highlights lend extraordinary depth here- the detail is also quite fantastic. I suspect this would have done better if it was a regular challenge. anyway- great shot.</td>', 'beautiful valley shot; the fore ground lighting and middle distance shading, coupled with the distant highlights lend extraordinary depth here- the detail is also quite fantastic. I suspect this would have done better if it was a regular challenge. anyway- great shot.', '2011-06-13 10:50:34.000000', NULL, 0),
